      "title": "Two ASN.1 encoder calls build values that are discarded",
      "description": "In `concatenatedRSToASN1DER`, the statements `ASN1Encoder.create().write(rBigInteger);` and `ASN1Encoder.create().write(sBigInteger);` create encoders, write into them, and drop the result. Nothing uses them. The method then builds the real DER sequence with a separate `writeDerSeq(...)` call. The two statements do no work and suggest a half-finished refactor. They should be removed so the method has one encoding path.",
